description: Verification gates — smallest covering tier
alwaysApply: true
---

# Gates

- **T1** copy/docs: `npx tsc --noEmit` + eslint touched files.
- **T2** one page/component: T1 + `npm run build` + matching spec(s) with `PW_NO_BUILD=1`.
- **T3** shared / "full gates": T1 + build + `PW_NO_BUILD=1 npm run test:e2e`.

No `/tmp` probes unless asked. Report tier + pass/fail only. No screenshots unless asked.
